@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3333

### Listar notas
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes

### Buscar a nota 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/1

### Nota que nao existe (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/999

### Id invalido (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/abc


### Id decimal (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/1.5

### Id zero (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/0

### Id negativo (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/-1